# Multi Container

A kanban board with three columns — items can be moved between containers.

Each column is its own `DndDroppable`, and all share one `DndController` via `DndProvider`. The `onDrop` callback receives `{ item, source, target }` — find the source column by `source.id`, remove the item, and insert it into the target column (`target.id`) at `target.position`.

